,"items":[{"question":"What exactly do we receive?","answer":"A typical engagement delivers visual org charts, salary benchmark tables, talent heatmaps and an executive summary. Files are supplied in spreadsheet and presentation formats, with a CSV export tagged for direct import into your ATS."},{"question":"How is this different from a LinkedIn search?","answer":"A LinkedIn search shows profiles; a market map shows structure and meaning. We verify findings across multiple sources, interpret what they mean for your search and format everything for client presentation. The output is a decision tool, not a list of names."},{"question":"How is market mapping priced?","answer":"Engagements are priced as a fixed monthly retainer per dedicated researcher, with scope agreed up front. Most projects run for two to six weeks, and there is no lock-in beyond the initial sprint you commission."},{"question":"Can you map a niche technical market?","answer":"Yes, provided we can agree target companies and seniority bands during scoping. Niche maps rely more on screening calls and referral chains, so they typically need one to two additional weeks and a short validation call at the halfway point."},{"question":"Is the data GDPR-compliant?","answer":"All personal data in maps is limited to professional information and handled under GDPR-aligned processes. Deliverables can be anonymised where your client requires it, and data retention periods are agreed during scoping."}]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"w-full py-space-3xl bg-surface","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin lg:px-margin-desktop space-y-space-2xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-space-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-space-xs max-w-xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"font-label-caps text-label-caps text-emerald-accent tracking-widest uppercase font-bold","child